A List View displays a table in the dialog.
Note
When displaying strings, Plant Simulation only shows the first 260 characters.
To add it to your dialog:
• Right-click the tab Elements and select New List View.
• Enter the Name of the list view. A Method object can call this dialog item using the Name you entered.
• Enter the Callback Argument, which will be passed to the Callback Method.
• Enter the name of a table or click the button 
  and select a table in the dialog Select Object.
◦ Activate the column index in the DataTable and enter the column headings which the list view shows
into the header cells.
◦ Enter the items which the list view shows into the cells of the columns.
