Create a Dialog Dynamically
Plant Simulation Help 10-1441
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

• We ran the Method named createDialog to enter what we programmed into the Dialog and show it.
You'll notice that it now shows the Name and the Label that we typed into createDialog in the Frame
named MyDynamicDialog.
• We programmed the action that double-clicking a row in the table on Tab 3 executes:
param action : string
var row:integer
print "Action : ",action
switch action
case "Open" 
case "Apply" 
case "Close" 
case "Button Arg" 
    @.setPasswordMasking("Text Box",NOT @.getPasswordMasking("Text Box"))
