case "List view Arg" 
    row := @.getIndex("List view")
    promptmessage(to_str("Where is the ", MyTable[1,row],"?"))
case "Check box" 
    @.setSensitive("A_Button", @.getCheckBox("Check box"))
end
Double-clicking a row in the table shows a message box with the question Where is the ...?
